# Response headers for Netlify and Cloudflare Pages (copied into build/web).
#
# Cross-origin isolation lets the WebAssembly renderer (flutter build web
# --wasm) use multiple threads. Without it the site still works, rendering
# single-threaded. `credentialless` keeps cross-origin fetches such as Google
# Fonts and the CanvasKit CDN working.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: credentialless
